{"id":12247,"author":"AlexTheEpic99","body":"\u003cb style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 23.9999980926514px;\"\u003e\u003cu\u003e\u003ci\u003eInfo:\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/u\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u0026nbsp;\u003c/b\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 23.9999980926514px;\"\u003eNitwit Core is meant to be a friendly Team community made for all types of players. We are connected to a YouTube Channel. Once we reach 10 members we will do Weekly videos. (If you have a YouTube channel and you are in the video, you WILL be included in the description). The Winner Of These Weekly Events And Videos Will Receive Special Prizes To Avicus.\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 23.9999980926514px;\"\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 23.9999980926514px;\"\u003e\u003cb style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 23.9999980926514px;\"\u003e\u003ci\u003e\u003cu\u003eRequirements:\u0026nbsp;\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003ci style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 23.9999980926514px;\"\u003e\u003cu\u003e\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003cu style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 23.9999980926514px;\"\u003e\u003c/u\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 23.9999980926514px;\"\u003e\u003cul style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 12px 25px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 23.9999980926514px;\"\u003e\u003cli style=\"line-height: 24px;\"\u003eFriendly Personality\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style=\"line-height: 24px;\"\u003eSkype Or TeamSpeak 3 (Skype would be better)\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style=\"line-height: 24px;\"\u003eActive\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ci style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 23.9999980926514px;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003cu\u003eWeekly Videos:\u0026nbsp;\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 23.9999980926514px;\"\u003e\u003cul style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 12px 25px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 23.9999980926514px;\"\u003e\u003cli style=\"line-height: 24px;\"\u003eNitwit Core (as said before) is connected to a YouTube Channel Partnered With Broadband TV Entertainment\u0026nbsp;\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style=\"line-height: 24px;\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://channelgraphs.com/network/BroadbandTV_Entertainment\" title=\"Link: https://channelgraphs.com/network/BroadbandTV_Entertainment\" style=\"color: rgb(3, 141, 210); text-decoration: none;\"\u003ehttps://channelgraphs.com/network/BroadbandTV_Entertainment\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style=\"line-height: 24px;\"\u003eEvery Week We Would be hosting small Videos on Avicus.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style=\"line-height: 24px;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003ci\u003e\u003cu\u003eIF YOU OWN A CHANNEL A LINK WOULD BE INCLUDED IN THE DESCRIPTION OF THE VIDEO\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style=\"line-height: 24px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-weight: bold;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-weight: 300;\"\u003eOn Special Occasions, Events Will be hosted by Nitwit Core on the Avicus Server Where Members can Earn Prizes (credits, ranks, etc.)\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style=\"line-height: 24px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-weight: bold;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-weight: 300;\"\u003eYou may be also asked if you would like to other Videos other Than Avicus or Even a choice to be a part owner of the channel\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cb style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 23.9999980926514px;\"\u003e\u003ci\u003e\u003cu\u003eNitwit Core Hosted\u0026nbsp;Tournaments:\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 23.9999980926514px;\"\u003eNitwit Core Will Also Hold Tournaments Only For Nitwit Core for a chance to win some sweet prices and offerings!\u003c/span\u003e\u003cb style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 23.9999980926514px;\"\u003e\u003ci\u003e\u003cu\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eYouTube Channel:\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCQgJGvElOcLKltAuK5DIW_Q\" title=\"Link: https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCQgJGvElOcLKltAuK5DIW_Q\" style=\"color: rgb(3, 141, 210); text-decoration: none; font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 23.9999980926514px;\"\u003ehttps://www.youtube.com/channel/UCQgJGvElOcLKltAuK5DIW_Q\u003c/a\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 23.9999980926514px;\"\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 23.9999980926514px;\"\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 23.9999980926514px;\"\u003e\u003cb style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 23.9999980926514px;\"\u003e\u003ci\u003e\u003cu\u003eHow To Join Nitwit Core:\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003cu style=\"color: rgb(51